Z||000010||Archie||11-01-2000||08:46 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BRIAN CORNELIUS:<BR><B>Richard, <BR>The chrystal you need is a 7.3728 MHz. Call Crystal Electronics at 651-631-2647 they have them. They are so cheap you may have to get more than one!<BR>                         BRIAN</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Cool, good information Brian. <P>About 11 years ago, when I bought the supply that I just ran out of, you couldn't buy the correct unit over the counter. At that time I had to have them custom made in lots of 500 at like $15 each out of some place in China. According to your news, some progress has been made since then.<P>Archie<p>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 11-01-2000).]||||reg||1
